# The Quick page: quickView1-6 in tableLayoutPanelQuick, two columns of three, each a
# description over a number. Bound as the Designer binds them - alt, groundspeed, wp_dist, yaw,
# verticalspeed, DistToHome - and described by GetNameandUnit: the property's [DisplayText] with
# its unit. A double click on one opens "Display This", the properties to choose from, and
# checking one binds the view to it and closes the chooser.
# `GCSViews/FlightData.Designer.cs:615-735, GCSViews/FlightData.cs:2474-2506, 4549-4650,
# ExtLibs/Controls/QuickView.cs, ExtLibs/ArduPilot/CurrentState.cs:4526-4552`
#
# Plays the recorded copter flight, so it needs no vehicle. Run from the repository root:
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-quick.gui -- file:testdata/mavlink/autotest.tlog

screen fly
window 1600x1200
settle 5

expect fly.tab tabQuick
expect fly.page.overflow 0
expect fly.quick.1 alt
expect fly.quick.1.label Altitude (m)
expect fly.quick.2 groundspeed
expect fly.quick.2.label GroundSpeed (m/s)
expect fly.quick.3 wp_dist
expect fly.quick.3.label Dist to WP (m)
expect fly.quick.4 yaw
expect fly.quick.4.label Yaw (deg)
expect fly.quick.5 verticalspeed
expect fly.quick.5.label Vertical Speed (m/s)
expect fly.quick.6 DistToHome
expect fly.quick.6.label Dist to Home (m)
# A number from the recording, written to two places.
expect fly.quick.1.value ~ .
expect fly.quick.4.value ~ .
# verticalspeed is CurrentState's own smoothed derivative of the altitude, which this application
# does not hold (docs/coverage/currentstate.md): its view shows no number rather than a made-up one.
expect fly.quick.5.value none
expect fly.quick.chooser none

# A double click opens the chooser for that view; every numeric property held is offered.
doubleclick fly-quick-3
expect fly.quick.chooser 3
expect fly.quick.choices 401
# Checking another binds the view to it and closes the chooser.
click fly-quick-choice-satcount
expect fly.quick.chooser none
expect fly.quick.3 satcount
expect fly.quick.3.label Sat Count
expect fly.quick.3.value ~ .00
# The others are untouched.
expect fly.quick.1 alt
expect fly.quick.6 DistToHome

# The form's close box closes it without choosing.
doubleclick fly-quick-6
expect fly.quick.chooser 6
click fly-quick-close
expect fly.quick.chooser none
expect fly.quick.6 DistToHome
